# The Formspree form both the waitlist and contact forms post to, e.g. https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz
# Each submission includes form: "waitlist" or "contact" so you can tell them apart.
# Leave empty and the waitlist just shows its thank-you message (storing nothing) and the contact
# form opens a pre-filled email to info@marketann.ai instead.
PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=
